# Smoke: add one Control to an existing baseline and accept it.
id: controls-smoke
skill: highway-controls
fixture: setup
smoke: yes
open: /highway-controls
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [edit] Add a Control: every staff account signs in with two-factor authentication, because a stolen password would expose customer orders.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
writes: library/governance/controls.md
writes: library/governance/controls/*.md
expect: template library/governance/controls.md :: control-catalog.md
expect: template library/governance/controls/*.md :: control-record.md
expect: contains-any library/governance/controls/*.md :: two-factor
shows: Your Controls are recorded.
